WEBVTT

00:08:29.597 --> 00:08:32.330
meet ambitious environmental goals.

00:08:32.963 --> 00:08:34.363
In Finland, for example,

00:08:34.363 --> 00:08:39.863
S Group aims at carbon negativity
by the year 2025.

00:08:40.763 --> 00:08:46.097
REScoop.eu, a network of 1,900
energy cooperatives

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:48.930
with way over one million members,

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:51.230
is promoting community energy,

00:08:51.263 --> 00:08:54.130
which is key to a decarbonized economy

00:08:54.163 --> 00:08:57.563
and a crucial step
in tackling climate change.

00:08:58.097 --> 00:09:01.663
This is about more
than windmills and solar panels.